<section id="story">
<h2>Brand story</h2>
<p>Nevara is the newest cabinet line from <strong>W.W. Wood Products in Dudley, Missouri</strong> — the same family-owned factory that builds Shiloh, Eclipse, and Aspect. Where Shiloh's story is breadth and Eclipse's is specialty materials, Nevara's story is <em>focus</em>: a tightly curated selection of SKUs, finishes, and door styles, engineered so dealers can quote faster, order with fewer decisions, and deliver consistent results at a price point that competes with in-stock and flat-pack cabinets.</p>

<p>The line was designed to sit <strong>about 50% below Eclipse</strong> while keeping the construction story intact: frameless full-access format, a full 3/4" plywood box, dovetail drawers, and Blum soft-close hardware — fully assembled in Missouri. As the line is newer, spec books, catalogs, and order forms are available through your Pinnacle rep and the WW Wood dealer portal.</p>
</section>

<section id="construction">
<h2>Construction &amp; specs anatomy</h2>
<p>Exactly what you're specifying when you order Nevara — read top to bottom.</p>

<div class="anatomy-wrap">
<table class="anatomy">
  <tbody>
    <tr><th scope="row">Construction</th><td>Frameless (full-access) — European-style construction, fully assembled by WW Wood.</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Cabinet box</th><td>Full 3/4" plywood box.</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Shelving</th><td>3/4" adjustable plywood shelves.</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Panels</th><td>Fully edge-banded panels.</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Drawer box</th><td>5/8" dovetailed solid-wood drawers.</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Hardware</th><td>Blum soft-close concealed hinges (adjustable); soft-close drawer performance standard.</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Door</th><td>Westbridge 5-piece Shaker in painted white MDF — ships standard.</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Pricing</th><td>Designed to land roughly 50% below Eclipse. Uses your existing Shiloh/Eclipse multipliers — no separate program to set up.</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Lead time</th><td>~5&ndash;6 weeks.</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Warranty</th><td>Confirm current warranty terms with your Pinnacle rep or the WW Wood dealer portal.</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Made in</th><td>Dudley, Missouri — W.W. Wood Products, family-owned, est. 1977.</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>

<section id="program">
<h2>Door &amp; finish program</h2>
<p>Nevara is intentionally the opposite of Shiloh's 50-style library. The program centers on the <strong>Westbridge</strong> door — a 5-piece Shaker profile in painted white MDF — with no color-customization program. That constraint is the feature: one decision instead of forty, a predictable finished product, and a price that holds.</p>

<div class="finish-grid">
  <div class="finish-card">
    <h3>What's in the program</h3>
    <p>Westbridge painted white 5-piece MDF Shaker door, full 3/4" plywood frameless boxes, dovetail drawers, Blum soft-close hardware, and the standard WW Wood spec-book sizing.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="finish-card">
    <h3>What's not</h3>
    <p>No stain program, no custom or multi-color paint program, no specialty materials, no inset. If the client's design turns on finish or color, step up to <a href="/dealer-hub/product-deep-dives/aspect">Aspect</a> or <a href="/dealer-hub/product-deep-dives/shiloh">Shiloh</a>; for specialty frameless fronts, <a href="/dealer-hub/product-deep-dives/eclipse">Eclipse</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="finish-card">
    <h3>Why it works</h3>
    <p>White Shaker remains the volume request in the territory. Nevara answers it with real plywood construction and soft-close performance at a price that competes with in-stock cabinets — while keeping the order inside the WW Wood portal, acknowledgment, and support process you already use.</p>
  </div>
</div>

